<title>USA: PLC Systems Inc Q1 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>PLC Systems Inc Q1 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKLIN, Mass. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.18   profit	 $0.07</p>
<p> Net loss		   3,022   profit	 1,277</p>
<p> Total revs		 1,588		    4,829</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  16,547		   17,030</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: In the above tabulated data the figures for the line &quot;Avg shrs&quot; refers to the shares used to compute net income (loss) per share.</p>
<p>The above tabulated results pertain to the first quarter period ending March 31, 1997 and 1996 respectively.</p>
